    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DEEP DARK IS A LINEAR STORY GAME ABOUT BEING STRANDED ALONE IN DEEP SPACE, AT THE END OF TIME. YOU FIND YOURSELF ISOLATED, WHERE NO ONE HEARS YOU CRY.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WILL YOU FIND THE SEQUENCE OF BUTTONS THAT WILL SAVE YOU? OR WILL YOU ROT IN SPACE FOREVER?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIND A WAY OUT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >THERE'S ONLY ONE WAY OUT OF THIS SITUATION; FIND THE SEQUENCE OF BUTTONS ON THE CONTROL PANEL THAT ALLOWS YOU TO ESCAPE.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DON'T LOSE YOUR MIND</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SPENDING TOO MUCH TIME IN ISOLATION CAN DAMAGE YOUR MIND. WILL YOU LOSE YOURS? OR WILL YOU FIND THE SEQUENCE IN TIME?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MOVE ON</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >EXPERIENCE A STORY ABOUT A PERSON DEALING WITH TRAGEDY, AND HOW IT DEVELOPS IN HIS MIND.</p>",
